    "ad0e9a57-c99d-4709-8388-2b106409ff5a": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "template--19262625481051__ad0e9a57-c99d-4709-8388-2b106409ff5a-1689197180f20b374f-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is Monthlies?",
            "row_content": "<p>We're a group of women dedicated to the idea that you deserve more than just painkillers to relieve menstrual discomfort. <br/><br/>Drawing from extensive research and expertise, we've developed Monthlies – a carefully formulated blend of minerals, vitamins, plant extracts, and more, providing an all-in-one solution for menstrual discomfort, and overall health.  <br/><br/>Our powder provides genuine relief, empowering you to thrive at every stage of your cycle.<br/><br/>As an all-female team of naturopathic doctors, we are passionate about empowering women to take control of their menstrual health. <br/><br/>We have witnessed firsthand the transformative impact of natural remedies on our patients' lives.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--19262625481051__ad0e9a57-c99d-4709-8388-2b106409ff5a-1689197180f20b374f-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is Monthlies right for me?",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>You're tired of period pain and the different menstrual symptoms that come along your cycle<br/></li><li>You want to be resilient and find calm, no matter what moment of your cycle you are<br/></li><li>You want to improve your overall health<br/></li><li>You want to feel energised</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>You're ready to take control of your cycle wellbeing<br/></li><li>You believe in the power of natural remedies and want to explore research-backed alternatives.</li></ul><p></p><p>Join us on this transformative journey towards a pain-free and empowered menstrual experience. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "685f7f4a-2356-4693-ac2f-6c74fa099fb4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I use the powder?",
            "row_content": "<p>Using the powder is easy! <br/><br/>Simply mix 1 scoop of powder with water, juice, or your preferred beverage. <br/><br/>Consume it daily as directed for optimal results. <br/><br/>It’s recommended to take it with food during the morning.It's convenient and hassle-free, fitting seamlessly into your daily routine.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "d3261cfc-a447-4ad0-abf1-553511c76560": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When can I expect to see results?",
            "row_content": "<p>While individual results may vary, 70% of our clients report noticeable improvements in their menstrual symptoms from the third month of taking the powder regularly. </p><p>Consistency is key, so it's important to continue using the product as instructed.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "23738499-e5c7-44f1-b0cd-2e8d7ab9c2d1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do contraceptive methods or fertility treatments impact the usage of the Monthlies' powder?",
            "row_content": "<p>In case of taking a contraceptive methods...<br/><br/>While you can certainly use the powder and see potential benefits, it's important to note that hormonal contraceptives, such as implants and pills, can affect hormone levels. <br/><br/><br/>When assessing the efficacy of the powder, its impact could be influenced by the contraceptive method you are utilising.<br/><br/>In case of a fertility treatment...<br/><br/>Fertility treatments often involve precise hormone manipulation that can influence hormonal test results. <br/><br/>It's vital to recognise that introducing new supplements, including the Monthlies' powder, should be done under the guidance of your healthcare provider. <br/><br/>The introduction of external supplements could potentially disrupt the intended hormonal adjustments of the treatment, emphasising the importance of professional consultation.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "23b85301-950f-45d0-8c6b-62d30a1960cd": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is the powder's blend compatible with any other supplements or vitamins that I might currently be taking?",
            "row_content": "<p>If you're currently using any medication or have been prescribed supplements for specific vitamin deficiencies, it's essential to consult your healthcare provider before incorporating Monthlies into your daily regimen.<br/><br/>The Monthlies blend has been crafted to provide a fundamental level of hormone support, aiming to fulfil your body's requirements. <br/><br/>This implies that you might not need to acquire extra vitamin and mineral supplements to address foundational hormone balance needs.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--19262625481051__ad0e9a57-c99d-4709-8388-2b106409ff5a-1689197180f20b374f-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Could you provide more details about the composition of the powder? Is it suitable for vegans? How does it taste?",
            "row_content": "<p>While the powder is currently suitable for vegetarians and 100% natural, it's important to note that it isn't suitable for vegans. <br/><br/>Why is that? It contains Vitamin D (cholecalciferol). Cholecalciferol is typically derived from animal sources, like lanolin (a substance found in sheep's wool) or fish liver oil. <br/><br/>However, we are actively working towards making it suitable for vegans.<br/><br/>In terms of flavour, we've dedicated careful attention to create a delightful orange taste, ensuring an enjoyable consumption experience. <br/><br/>If the taste poses a challenge, don't hesitate to reach out to us at info@withmonthlies.com. We're committed to finding a solution that suits your preferences!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "5d0a6c34-2a2e-4545-832a-9b74e902c76e": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is Your Formula Subscription? And, how does it work?",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Your Formula Subscription is the  option we offer to tailor your powder according to your hormone levels.</strong></p><p>Our goal is to create a powder  designed to address your unique hormonal imbalances responsible for your specific menstrual symptoms, such as cramps, bloating, tiredness, and more.<br/><br/><strong>Here's how it works: </strong></p><ol><li>First, you'll analyze your hormones with our at-home saliva Hormone Test (it's FREE). </li><li>Secondly, you'll have a conversation with an expert to discuss the hormone test results and your cycle health goals.</li><li>Thirdly, based on this discussion and your hormone results, we'll create a customized daily food supplement. </li></ol><p></p><p>This personalized blend combines vitamins, herbs, and nutrients carefully selected to support healthy estrogen metabolism and foster hormone balance, ultimately helping you achieve a more harmonious menstrual experience. <br/><br/>We offer it as a subscription, so you can get monthly deliveries at no additional cost. However, you have the flexibility to cancel your subscription at any time.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--19262625481051__ad0e9a57-c99d-4709-8388-2b106409ff5a-1689197180f20b374f-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer guarantees or refunds?",
            "row_content": "<p>We stand behind the quality and effectiveness of our products. </p><p>That's why we offer a 90-day money-back guarantee. </p><p>If you're not satisfied with your purchase, simply reach out to our customer support team within 90 days, and we'll assist you with a refund.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "953671b4-e62a-4d68-966b-6bcda8f005f6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does it take to receive my Monthlies package?",
            "row_content": "<p>Shipping can take up to 10 days.If you have any questions, please let us know at info@withmonthlies.com.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
